I'm using [eslint-config-mzgol](https://www.npmjs.com/package/eslint-config-mzgol) with a config in the root of the project directory:

``` json
{
    "extends": "mzgol",

    "root": true,

    "env": {
        "node": true
    },

    "rules": {
        "spaced-comment": 0,
        "prefer-spread": 0,
        "prefer-reflect": 0
    }
}
```

Then, in the directory `public/js` I have another `.eslintrc`:

``` json
{
    "env": {
        "es6": false,
        "browser": true,
        "node": false
    },

    "rules": {
        "no-var": 0,
        "object-shorthand": 0,
        "prefer-arrow-callback": 0,
        "prefer-const": 0,
        "prefer-spread": 0,
        "prefer-reflect": 0,
        "prefer-template": 0
    }
}
```

and yet ESLint doesn't fail on ES6 code inside of this directory.

ESLint 1.10.3.
